If you choose to join in this operation,

254
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:04,000
then descend the stairs
and get on the boat.

255
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:08,080
Let me be clear, this is not
an order, but an invitation.

256
00:17:09,020 --> 00:17:11,580
This decision is entirely yours to make.

257
00:17:12,180 --> 00:17:14,577
I understand what I'm getting myself into,

258
00:17:14,660 --> 00:17:17,248
and you're under no
obligation to follow me.

259
00:17:17,840 --> 00:17:20,899
Believe me, I realize how
all this must seem to you.

260
00:17:21,180 --> 00:17:23,980
But the actions I take
are righteous and just.

261
00:17:24,720 --> 00:17:25,740
I've no regrets.

262
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:30,435
Though our world is unjust, I will
strive to walk the path I believe in.

263
00:17:31,020 --> 00:17:33,000
Our retreat today isn't a defeat.

264
00:17:33,620 --> 00:17:36,679
Once we find his weakness,
I'll bring down the boss.

265
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:39,040
He will be toppled.

266
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:00,620
I understand.

267
00:18:01,840 --> 00:18:04,487
I believe you're trying
to do good, Pucurati.

268
00:18:04,660 --> 00:18:07,280
That said, I have to speak my truth, too.

269
00:18:08,140 --> 00:18:11,120
It hurts to say, but no
one is coming with you.

270
00:18:11,940 --> 00:18:14,411
I'm surprised you're being so sentimental.

271
00:18:15,020 --> 00:18:18,600
I owe you my life, but I
can't be a part of this.

272
00:18:19,460 --> 00:18:21,320
You've lost touch with reality.

273
00:18:21,780 --> 00:18:25,297
Lofty ideals alone won't get
you through this difficult life.

274
00:18:25,380 --> 00:18:27,940
We could never survive
without the Familia.

275
00:18:28,320 --> 00:18:29,791
You should listen to him.

276
00:18:30,340 --> 00:18:33,440
You've basically put the
gun in your own damn mouth.

277
00:18:33,780 --> 00:18:35,721
There's nowhere you can hide now.

278
00:18:35,860 --> 00:18:38,389
You'll have to live
life always on the run.

279
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:42,160
Remember, I pledged my loyalties
to the Familia at large.

280
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:45,798
And it's not like I ever
swore any allegiance to you.

281
00:18:48,140 --> 00:18:52,220
But even so, I've never had
a place to really call home.

282
00:18:52,460 --> 00:18:55,636
A place where I really felt
like I belonged, you know?

283
00:18:56,560 --> 00:18:59,677
The only time I've felt at ease is...

284
00:18:59,760 --> 00:19:02,600
Well, when I'm with you, Bucciarati.

285
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:06,510
Abacchio.

286
00:19:07,840 --> 00:19:08,670
What?

287
00:19:08,753 --> 00:19:10,440
You can't! Abacchio!

288
00:19:11,020 --> 00:19:12,980
Well, considering my skills,

289
00:19:13,380 --> 00:19:18,220
if we get rid of the boss, I'll
be next in line to beat Cabo.

290
00:19:19,420 --> 00:19:21,617
Listen, Bucciarati's
as smart as they come.

291
00:19:21,700 --> 00:19:24,877
No way in hell he'd take on
an opponent he couldn't beat.

292
00:19:24,960 --> 00:19:27,784
We're gonna be rolling
in sweet lira, amico mio.

293
00:19:28,480 --> 00:19:29,310
Mister!

294
00:19:29,393 --> 00:19:30,240
Not you two!

295
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:33,580
So, Fugo, what's it gonna
be? You coming with?

296
00:19:33,900 --> 00:19:34,800
You're crazy!

297
00:19:35,260 --> 00:19:36,848
You've all lost your minds!

298
00:19:37,180 --> 00:19:38,827
We'd be completely isolated!

299
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:40,647
Where could we possibly run?

300
00:19:40,880 --> 00:19:43,645
We wouldn't even make it
out of the city alive!

301
00:19:45,060 --> 00:19:47,119
Narancia, what are you going to do?

302
00:19:48,120 --> 00:19:49,360
I don't know.

303
00:19:49,840 --> 00:19:51,200
Please, tell me.

304
00:19:51,620 --> 00:19:54,200
What now, Bucciarati? Help me.

305
00:19:54,600 --> 00:19:55,700
What should I do?

306
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:58,294
Do you think I should go with you guys?

307
00:19:58,380 --> 00:20:00,220
Are you scared? I am.

308
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:04,520
I'm honestly scared out of my mind.
I need an order. Give me an order.

309
00:20:05,160 --> 00:20:08,737
Please just tell me to get my
ass in gear like you always do.

310
00:20:08,820 --> 00:20:11,585
Give me an order and I
won't be afraid anymore.

311
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:12,640
I will not.

312
00:20:13,060 --> 00:20:15,040
I can't decide your fate for you.

313
00:20:15,300 --> 00:20:16,577
The choice must be yours.

314
00:20:16,660 --> 00:20:20,740
Though we walk this world
together, your path belongs to you.

315
00:20:21,400 --> 00:20:23,341
But what does all that even mean?

316
00:20:23,640 --> 00:20:25,581
Dammit, what am I supposed to do?

317
00:20:25,840 --> 00:20:27,660
Listen, a word of caution.

318
00:20:28,380 --> 00:20:29,780
Stay here, Narancia.

319
00:20:30,560 --> 00:20:32,100
This is not your fight.

320
00:20:36,320 --> 00:20:39,557
then you're serious you'll
end up six feet under

321
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:42,237
i get what you're doing
but there's some things

322
00:20:42,320 --> 00:20:45,657
in this world you just
can't change being mafiosi

323
00:20:45,740 --> 00:20:48,477
means we can't always
take the high ground how's

324
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:50,397
this mission different
from any of the other dirty

325
00:20:50,480 --> 00:20:54,257
ones i can't answer that
i just know i refuse to

326
00:20:54,340 --> 00:21:00,197
live a lie let's be off
our departure will mark

327
00:21:00,280 --> 00:21:03,339
the beginning of our lives
as traitors to the Mafia.

328
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:09,677
Come on guys, think about
what you're doing here.

329
00:21:09,760 --> 00:21:13,977
We just met this girl, why throw your lives
away for someone you know nothing about?

330
00:21:14,060 --> 00:21:17,119
She won't even tell us what
kind of music she likes.

331
00:21:22,840 --> 00:21:26,664
She was betrayed by the one she
thought she could trust the most.

332
00:21:28,060 --> 00:21:31,280
I know how she feels, I know that pain.

333
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:37,040
My own father, the people I thought
were my friends, they abandoned me.

334
00:21:38,140 --> 00:21:39,077
We're the same.

335
00:21:39,160 --> 00:21:41,120
We've both been through hell.

336
00:21:41,620 --> 00:21:45,660
The world's kicked both of us
around, and so I have to...

337
00:21:49,480 --> 00:21:51,297
Jonah, the turtle, please.

338
00:21:51,380 --> 00:21:53,740
Trish can hide inside. Got it.

339
00:21:55,620 --> 00:21:59,300
You should really take a
look behind you. Bucciarati!

340
00:22:02,600 --> 00:22:05,040
I'm going with you! I'm right here!

341
00:22:05,320 --> 00:22:06,202
Don't leave me!

342
00:22:07,300 --> 00:22:09,900
Please don't tell me to stay behind!

343
00:22:10,160 --> 00:22:11,680
Trish and I are the same!

344
00:22:11,920 --> 00:22:14,520
Her wounds are my wounds! Her pain!

345
00:22:14,740 --> 00:22:15,820
It's my pain!

346
00:22:19,860 --> 00:22:21,960
Narancia, you're turning two.

347
00:22:22,760 --> 00:22:25,480
You fool, you're going to be killed.

348
00:22:29,360 --> 00:22:32,840
I just can't be a part of this
ridiculous game of betrayal.

349
00:22:33,580 --> 00:22:36,120
I won't be a martyr. I refuse.

350
00:22:42,040 --> 00:22:45,137
You sure took your sweet-ass
time getting here, buddy.

351
00:22:45,220 --> 00:22:47,497
You better not bitch
and moan the whole time.

352
00:22:47,580 --> 00:22:48,410
You got it?

353
00:22:48,493 --> 00:22:51,774
Narancia, you'll forever have
my respect for doing this.

354
00:22:53,480 --> 00:22:55,560
So, Fugo stayed behind after all.

355
00:22:55,780 --> 00:22:58,040
Well, that was his decision to make.

356
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:06,940
Bucciarati, I want to protect
Trish with everything I've got.

357
00:23:07,240 --> 00:23:09,358
I swear to defeat the boss with you.

358
00:23:09,700 --> 00:23:10,640
Sounds good.

359
00:23:19,500 --> 00:23:20,330
Squalo?

360
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:24,260
Looks like we've got ourselves
some traitors in Venice.

361
00:23:24,740 --> 00:23:25,740
Their names?

362
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:28,720
Bruno Bucciarati and Giorno Giovanna.

363
00:23:29,880 --> 00:23:31,780
Capture them dead or alive.

364
00:23:32,120 --> 00:23:34,420
These are the boss's direct orders.

365
00:24:08,000 --> 00:24:09,440
Thank you.
